  "description": "Moonberry Soda – Cute Retro Bubble Font | Groovy Bold Display Font with Alternates & Multilingual Support\nIntroducing Moonberry Soda, a playful retro bubble font inspired by vintage aesthetics, groovy typography, and nostalgic Y2K vibes. This bold display font features soft rounded curves, charming heart details, stylish alternates, and over 300 glyphs, making it perfect for creative projects that need a fun and eye-catching look.\nWhether you’re creating T-shirts, stickers, Cricut projects, logos, branding, invitations, packaging, social media graphics, posters, YouTube thumbnails, Etsy products, or printable designs, Moonberry Soda adds a cheerful personality to every project.\nDesigned with versatility in mind, this font includes multilingual support, alternate characters, decorative symbols, and bonus graphic elements so you can create unique typography with ease.\nFont Features\n✔ Bold Bubble Letters\n✔ Cute Retro Style\n✔ Groovy Display Tow StyleTypeface\n✔ Uppercase & Lowercase\n✔ Numbers & Punctuation\n✔ 300+ Glyphs\n✔ Stylistic Alternates\n✔ Multilingual Support\n✔ Decorative Symbols\n✔ Bonus  EPS Elements(29)\n✔ 2 OTF\n✔ 2 TTF",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Moonberry Soda – Cute Retro Bubble Font | Groovy Bold Display Font with Alternates &amp; Multilingual Support</p>\n<p>Introducing Moonberry Soda, a playful retro bubble font inspired by vintage aesthetics, groovy typography, and nostalgic Y2K vibes. This bold display font features soft rounded curves, charming heart details, stylish alternates, and over 300 glyphs, making it perfect for creative projects that need a fun and eye-catching look.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating T-shirts, stickers, Cricut projects, logos, branding, invitations, packaging, social media graphics, posters, YouTube thumbnails, Etsy products, or printable designs, Moonberry Soda adds a cheerful personality to every project.</p>\n<p>Designed with versatility in mind, this font includes multilingual support, alternate characters, decorative symbols, and bonus graphic elements so you can create unique typography with ease.</p>\n<p>Font Features<br>\n✔ Bold Bubble Letters<br>\n✔ Cute Retro Style<br>\n✔ Groovy Display Tow StyleTypeface<br>\n✔ Uppercase &amp; Lowercase<br>\n✔ Numbers &amp; Punctuation<br>\n✔ 300+ Glyphs<br>\n✔ Stylistic Alternates<br>\n✔ Multilingual Support<br>\n✔ Decorative Symbols<br>\n✔ Bonus  EPS Elements(29)<br>\n✔ 2 OTF<br>\n✔ 2 TTF</p>",
